{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/keptn-integrations/shell","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:17:11.411Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/keptn/keptn-integrations/shell","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/keptn/keptn-integrations/shell"},"readme":"# Shell Script Execution\n\nExecute any shell script with Keptn by using the [Job Executor Service](https://artifacthub.io/packages/keptn/keptn-integrations/job-executor-service)\n\nFor example:\n```\napiVersion: v2\nactions:\n  - name: \"Run alpine image to say hello world\"\n    events:\n      - name: \"sh.keptn.event.hello-world.triggered\"\n    tasks:\n      - name: \"Say Hello World\"\n        image: \"alpine\"\n        cmd:\n          - echo\n        args:\n          - 'Hello, world!'\n```","readmeBase":"https://keptn.sh/docs/integrations/","publisher":{"name":"Keptn","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=keptn","official":false,"verified":true,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2022-02-02T00:00:00.000Z","categories":["Integration and delivery"],"keywords":["keptn","shell","bash"],"license":"Apache-2.0","links":[{"name":"home","url":"https://keptn.sh/docs/integrations/"},{"name":"Source","url":"https://keptn.sh"},{"name":"Keptn integrations repository","url":"https://github.com/keptn-sandbox/artifacthub"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":0,"subscriptions":0},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"1.0.0","digest":"sha256:2021-02-02T00:00:00Z","pushed":"2022-02-02T00:00:00.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":null}],"tagsTotal":1,"security":null,"install":null,"version":"1.0.0","appVersion":null,"containersImages":[],"contentUrl":null,"signed":false,"deprecated":false,"repo":{"name":"keptn-integrations","url":"https://github.com/keptn-sandbox/artifacthub","kind":"Keptn integration"},"logo":{"url":"https://artifacthub.io/image/82252312-77c3-44b3-9a82-af